<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: CZECH UTILITY Severoceske Teplarny 1996 NET PROFIT RISES.</title>
<headline>CZECH UTILITY Severoceske Teplarny 1996 NET PROFIT RISES.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results for year ending December 31, 1996, according to Czech accounting standards: (in millions of crowns)</p>
<p> Net profit		    125.03   vs	 100.88</p>
<p> Gross profit		  186.70   vs	 175.00</p>
<p> Operating profit	    177.98   vs	 175.79</p>
<p> Output			  865.92   vs	 891.21</p>
<p>Sales of own goods</p>
<p> and services		  831.25   vs	 870.53</p>
<p> Total assets		1,901.43   vs     1,772.61</p>
<p> Basic capital	     1,133.28   vs     1,772.61</p>
<p>NOTE. Full company name is Severoceske Teplarny a.s. The firm is a household heating supplier in northern Bohemia. Its shares are traded on the main market of the Prague Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 420-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
